* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* NOMVER-P
* Show the NOM version. Template: NOPVER-P, for Unix installation routine
* The version is being obtained from the NOM system file 1.
*
* -------------------------------------------------------------------------
* User Id yyyy-mm-ss Mark      Comment
* ------- ---------- --------  ---------------------------------------- ---
* fhi     2008-02-22 created   show NOM system file version for install ation
* bli     2012-09-14           NOMALL-94 Version can be 2 digits        ation
* fhi     2013-05-08           NOMALL-1214 Introduce new migration flagsation
* fhi     2016-11-15 NOMALL-1961 Use new task IDs
* SU2     2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 recat for VMONIT-L
* SU3     2021-04-22 NOMALL-2454 recat for VMONIT-L M-NATRPT-DBID/-FNR
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA
LOCAL USING VMONIT-L
LOCAL
1 #VERSION (A13)
*
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
NRM-MONITOR.M-MONITOR-ID := F#MONITOR-TASK-ID1 (<>)
FIND NRM-MONITOR WITH M-MONITOR-ID = NRM-MONITOR.M-MONITOR-ID
  IF NO RECORDS FOUND
    WRITE NOTITLE NOHDR 'NOM System File Version empty'
    ESCAPE BOTTOM
  END-NOREC
  COMPRESS M-VERS-VERSION-A M-VERS-RELEASE-A M-VERS-SP-A M-VERS-CF-A
    TO #VERSION LEAVING NO
  WRITE NOTITLE NOHDR 'NOM System File Version' #VERSION
END-FIND
IF M-VERS-MIGRATION-IN-PROGRESS = 'Y'
  WRITE NOTITLE NOHDR 'Migration process ongoing.'
END-IF
*
END
